{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43332","headline":"天骥呈材 · 徐仁嗣","name":"天骥呈材","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至德符天道，龙媒应圣明。\n追风奇质异，喷玉彩毛轻。\n躞蹀形难状，连拳势乍呈。\n効材矜逸态，绝影表殊名。\n岐路宁辞远，关山岂惮行。\n盐车虽不驾，今日亦长鸣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐仁嗣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}